<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Camelot raises A$10 mln in placement.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Camelot raises A$10 mln in placement.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Camelot Resources NL said on Thursday it has completed a placement of 40 million new ordinary shares to raise A$10 million.</p>
<p>The proceeds of the placement would be used to fund part of Camelot's share of the cost of the joint takeover offer for Mount Edon Gold Mines (Aust.) Ltd, announced on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Camelot and Teck Corp on Wednesday announced an A$2.15 per share or A$158 million bid for Mt Edon</p>
<p>Camelot said the placement to Teck Corp and clients of J.B. Were &amp; Son would increase Teck Corp's stake in Camelot to about 19.9 percent. -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
